  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "日頭公變魔術"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><b>作者：許嘉勇</b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">透早時ê日頭</span></p><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">kāng天頂變做白phú-phú ê毯仔</span></p></blockquote><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">雞未啼、狗未吠</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">早餐店ê鼎灶已經tshiâng-tshiâng滾</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">早起時ê日頭</span></p><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">kāng天頂變做青lang-lang ê大海</span></p></blockquote><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">士農工商計精神--looh</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">隨个仔隨个開始lerh無閒</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">中晝時ê日頭</span></p><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">kāng天頂變做燒hōng-hōng ê火爐</span></p></blockquote><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">Lán腹肚tio̍h thui hōo飽</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">Tsiah有khuì力thang拚下晡ê穡頭</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">Berh暗仔ê日頭</span></p><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">kāng天頂變做黃gìm-gìm ê膨柑</span></p></blockquote><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">人kap鳥隻sann-sâng</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">一隻一隻飛tńg去家己（kāi-kī）ê siū</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">暗暝仔ê日頭</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">kāng天頂變做烏sô-sô ê墨盤</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">天星爍--一-下、爍--一-下</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">Buě輸是火金蛄lerh serh：「Iá未睏--ooh！」</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></p><p><br /></p><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><br /></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span><b>做伙來唸詩</b></span><b><span>專欄，</span><span>本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap臺灣閩南語羅馬字拼音方案。</span></b></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><b>台文通訊BONG報327期，2021年6月出刊。</b></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">歡迎捐款贊助　李江却台語文教基金會　（捐款thang抵稅，匯款了後請通知02-23112199）</span></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><div><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">線上捐款(定期定額)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2FfF5bhx&amp;h=AT1fIGbvLe-H1RfIAEmaBwSoHSud2mWn8lrfo0xPDXLyCEJ6_oyPKdt-VNpBwe2ie9QCjJZfObjdC0zbQCynJ54D2Wi_b8ZrVcDWstK8-oYv8FmldyEJo_KdoHuWC05sSueoTuSvJ5cr-p_vScPimOGX4wzN4y0tm93TSYPwa_Oy3MkFQCQALsRTZFMOuwZl3PJcYWBoT4jwc6